{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS21viMzyHHhfbpsd8fb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the generator with a one-word change. The lower bound of each heart-rate target is now `start` instead of `value`. I haven't pushed it to Intervals or synced a watch, so whether the watch now shows the right numbers is still unconfirmed.\n\n- **The bug:** Intervals sends `{value, end}` to the watch as a zone-based target, and the watch snaps it to its own heart-rate zones. That's what `readback/watch-notes.md` shows: every range is one of the watch's zone bands, never the planned 151–160 or 129–141.\n- **The fix:** with `{start, end}`, Intervals sends the exact bpm range it calculates from its own LTHR (172), and the watch shows that range as is. Targets stay as percentages of LTHR; only the key name changed, in `hr_target()` in `gen.py`.\n- **What I checked:** running `gen.py` on `plans/tempo-run.json` now writes `start`/`end` for all four steps, including the two inside the 3× repeat.\n- **To confirm on the watch:** run `./push.sh`, sync through Garmin Connect, and check the Tempo step shows about 151–160 and the Float step about 129–141. The watch's own LTHR is 168, not 172, so matching numbers would show the targets come from Intervals and not the watch.\n\nFrom your colleague's note, I used the `start` vs `value` finding, the advice to keep percentages of LTHR, and the way to check it on the watch. Their two failed attempts matched what your notes record, so I didn't retry either. I left out the extra text `description` field for showing steps in the Intervals web interface. Nobody reported missing steps, and their note says a version Intervals can't read deletes the steps completely. It's the next thing to look at if steps don't show up there.\n\n`ANSWER.md` has the full explanation, the expected range for every step, and which parts of the note applied."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1476,"cache_read_input_tokens":25432,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1476},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"18febdff-8ffa-461d-87f4-f4f9a0ad8f74","uuid":"c8839a49-a1e2-4220-9444-6269195243cc","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:18:10.283Z","request_id":"req_011CgS21vUUTkEjhMTK9LqUg"}
